-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:15pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:14pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal">When a student creates a new IT support ticket, they only need to enter the Caller Name and Short Description of the issue. The student does not need to manually select the Category or Subcategory. Once the ticket is submitted, a Flow Designer automation is triggered and evaluates the Short Description for predefined keywords such as WiFi, Projector, Password, or Slow. Based on the identified keyword, the flow automatically assigns the appropriate Category and Subcategory to the ticket. </span></p><ul class="lst-kix_lh8teks4516u-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">If the short description contains the word </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:italic;font-weight:400">WiFi</span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">, the flow assigns </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Category = Network</span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;and </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Subcategory = WiFi</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal">.<br></span></li><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">If the description contains </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:italic;font-weight:400">Projector</span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">, the flow assigns </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Category = Hardware</span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;and </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Subcategory = Projector</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal">.<br></span></li><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">If the description includes </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:italic;font-weight:400">Password</span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;or </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:italic;font-weight:400">Login</span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">, the flow assigns </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Category = Access</span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;and </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Subcategory = Forgot Password</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal">.<br></span></li><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">If the description mentions </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:italic;font-weight:400">Slow</span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;or </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:italic;font-weight:400">Hanging</span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">, the flow assigns </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Category = Performance</span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;and </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Subcategory = Slow Computer</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal">.<br></span>