olor:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><h1 id="h.81ndw68fqev3" style="padding-top:24pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:20pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:17pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal">Conclusion</span></h1><ul class="lst-kix_7oq2s4gqoraj-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">The </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Auto Ticket Classification using Flow Designer</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;project successfully delivers a complete, end-to-end automation solution for a school IT helpdesk. The primary objective of reducing manual effort in ticket categorization and improving response efficiency has been fully achieved.</span></li><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal">Through structured requirement analysis, careful backend configuration, and no-code automation using Flow Designer, the system now automatically classifies IT tickets based on the short description provided by students. The implementation of dependent choice fields ensures data accuracy, while automated email notifications improve communication by instantly acknowledging ticket creation to the caller.</span></li><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal">The solution was developed using a phased approach, ensuring clarity, stability, and ease of maintenance. Comprehensive testing and security validation confirmed that the system functions reliably, maintains data integrity, and enforces appropriate access controls.</span></li><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal">Overall, this project demonstrates how ServiceNow can be effectively used to build scalable, maintainable, and user-friendly automation solutions without relying on complex scripting or machine learning. The design is well-suited for small to medium environments such as educational institutions and can be easily extended in the future to include advanced features like assignment automation, SLA tracking, or predictive intelligence.</span></li></ul><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p></div></div></div></div></body></html>
